# Allowlist and pins for the optional extra mod jars on the live NeoForge shard (docs/runbooks/nf-extra-mods.md).
# One line per mod: <name> <sha256-lowercase-hex> <jar-file-name> <version>, the fields separated by one space. The names here
# are the whole allowlist: NF_EXTRA_MODS may name only these, and the entrypoint's extra_prep/extra_copy calls must match them.
# Lines starting with # are comments. Tests in tools/repo-checks/src/nf-extra-mods.test.ts keep this file, the overlays and the
# entrypoint in step.
